WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.920 --> 00:00:02.040
- We can move that.

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.168
Jerry, yes!

00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:04.941
- [Crowd] Jerry, Jerry!

00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:06.523
- I love it!
- Thank you.

00:00:06.523 --> 00:00:08.131
- Okay, wait.

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:10.964
Does that, we did not prompt them.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.180
Does that happen everywhere you go?

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.520
- It happens everywhere I go,

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:18.023
but the most embarrassing
place it ever happened.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:21.160
I like football, so I went to,

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.110
I think it was the Giants football game,

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.300
and at half-time you go to the men's room.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.580
Well, in the stadiums, the men's room,

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.360
they have 500 guys in there at a time.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:35.260
So I go in there, it's my turn,

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:39.320
and 500 guys start
chanting, "Jerry, Jerry!"

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:44.232
Well, at my age, I don't
need anymore pressure.

00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:45.550
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.950
And it's like, "Oh, gosh."

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.222
I said, "I'll be right
with you, all right?"

00:00:50.222 --> 00:00:51.055
(Kelly laughs)

